1972  328B              ; FormatScore24ToBuf — DrawNumBuf = decimal of VDC_PlayerScore (up to 8 digits,
1973  328B              ; leading zeros blanked to spaces, which render at zero width). Clobbers all.
1974  328B              ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
1975  328B              FormatScore24ToBuf:
1976  328B 2A DD 6C                     LD   HL, (Core.VDC_PlayerScore)
1977  328E 22 2C 33                     LD   (Score24Work), HL
