2439  3B73              ; Frog_RefilterCurrent — каждый кадр check BallColor/NextBallColor against
2440  3B73              ; chain mask; replace если color удалён cascade match-3.
2441  3B73              Frog_RefilterCurrent:
2442  3B73 3A E5 6C                     LD   A, (Core.Frog_BallColor)
2443  3B76 CD C7 3A                     CALL Frog_FilteredRandomColor
