   4+ 3DA9              LoadLevelSelectPreviewMarkers:
   5+ 3DA9 F3                           DI
   6+ 3DAA                              SetPage3 UI_OVL_PAGE                   ; keep the level-select (UI) page mapped: SafeInflatePage2
   6+ 3DAA             >                ifdef MAPPING_REGISTERS
