   8+ 3DAF                                                                     ; `SetPage3 #04` (from the legacy FT.Coprocessor.Inflate path
   9+ 3DAF                                                                     ; that DID use slot 3) is vestigial. Mapping the gameplay page
  10+ 3DAF                                                                     ; here is unnecessary and inconsistent post-split.
  11+ 3DAF 21 00 00                     LD   HL, 0
  12+ 3DB2 D9                           EXX
  13+ 3DB3 06 01                        LD   B, 1
  14+ 3DB5 D9                           EXX
  15+ 3DB6 21 00 00                     LD   HL, 0
  16+ 3DB9 3E BA                        LD   A, LS_PREVIEW_FROG_PAGE
  17+ 3DBB 08                           EX   AF, AF'
