 495+ C36C FE 03                        CP   3
 496+ C36E 38 0B                        JR   C, .upd_not_pause       ; <3 (none/retry/gameover) → normal path
 497+ C370                              ; >=3: pause (3) or pause fade-out (4) — freeze gameplay, refresh
 498+ C370                              ; the RTC baseline so the paused/fading seconds are not counted.
 499+ C370 CD 02 C3                     CALL ReadRTCSeconds
