 720+ C501              ; ============================================================================
 721+ C501              ; VDC_UpdateRtcElapsed — real-time game clock from RTC seconds.
 722+ C501              ;   Adds delta seconds with 0..59 wrap. Called only during PLAY; pause refreshes
