2534+ CE9A E6 01                        AND  1
2535+ CE9C CB 3C                        SRL  H
2535+ CE9E CB 1D          RR L
2536+ CEA0 30 04                        JR   NC, .rc_no_xor
2537+ CEA2 7C                           LD   A, H
2537+ CEA3 EE B4          XOR #B4
2537+ CEA5 67             LD H, A          ; poly #B400 (low=0)
