 341+ ED05                              ; --- VDC chain rendering: per-ball tangent + grouped matrix emit.
 342+ ED05                              ; Algorithm:
 343+ ED05                              ;   Pre-pass: cache stable tangent, cell, Vx, Vy for each ball.
 344+ ED05                              ;   Draw: quantize tangent to 8 BRAD and emit matrix only when it
 345+ ED05                              ;   differs from the previous visible ball. This keeps per-slot
 346+ ED05                              ;   tangent stability without the old bucket segment flicker.
 347+ ED05 0E FF                        LD   C, 255
 347+ ED07 16 FF          LD D, 255
 347+ ED09 1E FF          LD E, 255
 348+ ED0B CD 6E 13                     CALL FT.Coprocessor.ColorRGB
 349+ ED0E CD 16 EF                     CALL ZL_DrawActiveChainForLevel
 350+ ED11 3A E9 D4                     LD   A, (VDC_HasSecondChain)
 351+ ED14 B7                           OR   A
 352+ ED15 CA B2 F4                     JP   Z, ZL_AfterChains
 353+ ED18 CD 4C C2                     CALL VDC_SwapChains
 354+ ED1B CD 2E 5F                     CALL SetSecondTrackPage
 355+ ED1E 0E FF                        LD   C, 255
 355+ ED20 16 FF          LD D, 255
 355+ ED22 1E FF          LD E, 255
 356+ ED24 CD 6E 13                     CALL FT.Coprocessor.ColorRGB
 357+ ED27 CD 16 EF                     CALL ZL_DrawActiveChainForLevel
 358+ ED2A CD 4C C2                     CALL VDC_SwapChains
 359+ ED2D CD 1C 5F                     CALL SetCurrentTrackPage
 360+ ED30 C3 B2 F4                     JP   ZL_AfterChains
