1472+ F76B 87                           ADD  A, A                             ; CF = top bit of multiplier
1473+ F76C 30 01                        JR   NC, .skip
1474+ F76E 09                           ADD  HL, BC                            ; if bit set → +BC
1475+ F76F 15           .skip:          DEC  D
1476+ F770 20 F8                        JR   NZ, .lp
1477+ F772 C9                           RET
