1720+ FB92 CB 3F          SRL A
1720+ FB94 CB 3F          SRL A                  ; A = bucket (0..31)
1721+ FB96 5F                           LD   E, A
1721+ FB97 16 00          LD D, 0
1722+ FB99 21 00 00                     LD   HL, 0
1723+ FB9C 19                           ADD  HL, DE
1724+ FB9D 29                           ADD  HL, HL
1724+ FB9E 29             ADD HL, HL
1724+ FB9F 29             ADD HL, HL   ; ×8
1725+ FBA0 44                           LD   B, H
1725+ FBA1 4D             LD C, L
