 202+ C1FA              ; In: B = table entries, HL = entries. Every current menu stream is <64K and
 203+ C1FA              ; starts at source offset #0000, so the table keeps only RAM_G dest/page/size.
 204+ C1FA              MenuInflateAssetsFromTable:
 205+ C1FA C5           .next:          PUSH BC
