1644+ D744              ; ZiFi_PakReadToc — read TOC sector (sec 1), copy entry [A] to ZiFi_LevelTOC.
1645+ D744              ; In  : A = level index (0..21)
1646+ D744              ; Out : ZiFi_LevelTOC filled with 20 bytes; CF=1 ok, CF=0 absent slot.
1647+ D744              ;       Pak must already be open (ZiFi_PakOpen called first).
