1692+ D784              ; ZiFi_SkipSectors16 — skip HL (16-bit) sectors forward.
1693+ D784              ; Do not use LOADNON for large seeks here. Fresh host dump 111 showed the
1694+ D784              ; loader stuck immediately after TOC while seeking L02 bg_off=#01F0 through
